{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06811","headline":"送欧阳会稽之任 · 王昌龄","name":"送欧阳会稽之任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怀禄贵心赏，东流山水长。\n官移会稽郡，地迩上虞乡。\n缓带屏纷杂，渔舟临讼堂。\n逶迤回谿趣，猿啸飞鸟行。\n万室霁朝雨，千峰迎夕阳。\n辉辉远洲暎，暧暧澄湖光。\n白发有高士，青春期上皇。\n应须枉车歇，爲我访荷裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}